<figure class="wp-block-image"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="964" height="1350" src="https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Chicken-Tikka-Masala_3-1.jpg" alt="Close up of naan bread being used to scoop up some Chicken Tikka Masala." class="wp-image-28183" srcset="https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Chicken-Tikka-Masala_3-1.jpg?resize=964%2C1350&amp;zoom=1 964w, https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Chicken-Tikka-Masala_3-1.jpg?resize=964%2C1350&amp;zoom=0.8 771w, https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Chicken-Tikka-Masala_3-1.jpg?resize=964%2C1350&amp;zoom=0.67 646w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) calc((100vw - 40px) * .31623931623931625), calc(100vw - 200px)" data-pin-media="https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Chicken-Tikka-Masala_3-1.jpg"></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center" id="h-watch-how-to-make-it"><span style="color: #808080;"><strong>WATCH HOW TO MAKE IT</strong></span></h2>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
