<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center" id="h-life-of-dozer"><span style="color: #808080;"><strong>LIFE OF DOZER</strong></span></h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Miserable, sulky post-swim hose down. No feeling sorry for him! He just spent the last hour swimming and rolling in sand!!!</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1013" height="1350" src="https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Dozer-getting-hosed-down.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-28188" srcset="https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Dozer-getting-hosed-down.jpg?resize=1013%2C1350&amp;zoom=1 1013w, https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Dozer-getting-hosed-down.jpg?resize=1013%2C1350&amp;zoom=0.76 770w, https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Dozer-getting-hosed-down.jpg?resize=1013%2C1350&amp;zoom=0.64 648w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) calc((100vw - 40px) * .31623931623931625), calc(100vw - 200px)" data-pin-media="https://www.recipetineats.com/tachyon/2018/04/Dozer-getting-hosed-down.jpg"></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>


