   	 											Dozer was my beautiful dog and faithful companion for 14 years. He was also official taste-tester of RecipeTin Eats, and filled every day with joy, mischief and laughs. He passed away in February 2026. I miss him every day. The Life Of Dozer section shares the happiest moments of his life and keeps his memory alive. Read more about him <a href="https://www.recipetineats.com/dozer-the-golden-retriever-dog/">here</a>.						</p>
			<div class="life-of-dozer-context__memorial">
