				<img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a5ef2ce4ed67e62254147c566fd13d15fdc09e49dcae193b4bd2de20a56767ad?s=40&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.recipetineats.com%2Ftachyon%2F2024%2F06%2Favatar-guest-temp-cache-bust-duplicate.png&#038;r=g' srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a5ef2ce4ed67e62254147c566fd13d15fdc09e49dcae193b4bd2de20a56767ad?s=80&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.recipetineats.com%2Ftachyon%2F2024%2F06%2Favatar-guest-temp-cache-bust-duplicate.png&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-40 photo' height='40' width='40' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/><span class="comment-author-name">Mj</span> <span class="says">says</span>			</p>

